{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34464","headline":"袭美留振文宴龟蒙抱病不赴猥示倡和因次韵酬谢 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美留振文宴龟蒙抱病不赴猥示倡和因次韵酬谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮席风开照露晴，祗将茶荈代云觥。\n繁弦似玉纷纷碎，佳妓如鸿一一惊。\n毫健几多飞藻客，羽寒寥落映花莺。\n幽人独自西窗晚，闲凭香柽反照明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}